			<!-- The Time Worm has no dedicated Firaxis mesh in this mod yet.
			     Use the closest neutral recon silhouette (Scout) as an explicit
			     replacement so the unit renders instead of falling back to a
			     missing ArtDef.  The unit description labels this replacement. -->
